ship.\n•\tNavshakti Award by Late Vilasrao Deshmukh for being a shining and emerging representative of people \n•\tBest social worker award by Acharya Atre Pratishthan, Pune.\n•\tRajhans Pratishthan Award for commendable social work.\n•\tArvind Bhushan Award by Jogeshwari Education Society.\n•\tPraja Foundation’s Committed MLA Award, selected from all the Legislatures from Mumbai.   \n\nPolitical work (Posts held in Party/ Organization and Duration)\n\n•\tActive member of Shivsena since its inception.\n•\tSampark Pramukh, Parbhani District (2004-2008).\n•\tMunicipal Council Chairman, Parbhani was elected from Shivsena for the first time during this tenure.\n•\tAppointed as Chief Whip, Shivsena Legislature Party in the year 2009.\n•\tAppointed as Secretary, Maasaheb Meenatai Thakre Smarak Samiti, Mumbai.\n\nService rendered as a Member /Committee Chairman of Legislative and Parliamentary Committees\n\n•\tMember, Private Charitable Hospitals Committee since 2011.\n•\tMinister in the Department of Housing and Higher and Technical Education in the year 2014.\n•\tGuardian Minister of Ratnagiri District in the year 2014.\n•\tPublic Relations Minister of Kolhapur District in the year 2015.\n\n","freedom":"N","mainProfessionName":"BUSINESSPERSON","otherProfessionName":"SOCIAL WORKER","categoryCode":" ","loksabhaExpr":"18","createdAt":"2025-08-15 14:09:37.975701","updatedAt":"2025-08-15 14:09:37.975701","icNo":null}